        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door transit time for Car Transport Delhi To Mangalore is 3‑4 business days, depending on traffic along the NH 19 corridor, weather conditions, and any scheduled maintenance stops. Our live GPS tracking lets you monitor progress in real time, ensuring you stay informed throughout the journey.</p>
