        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No. The quote you receive for Car Transport Delhi To Mangalore is all‑inclusive, covering base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any statutory fees. Optional services such as extra padding or expedited delivery are listed separately, so you can decide before confirming the booking without surprise costs.</p>
